.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/05/3930583/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、ニコ生の前に 取材うけてきます.♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 大好きですよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし。ろってぃー or まに ←笑"}],"source":"archive"}